# ==============================================================================
# Unity .gitignore for Word-Crush
# Keeps source + assets; excludes Unity's regenerated caches and IDE project files.
# (Library/ alone is multiple GB of derived cache — never commit it.)
# ==============================================================================

# --- Unity generated / derived folders ---
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Asset meta files must stay tracked alongside their assets (Unity breaks without them),
# so re-include any .meta even if a parent rule above would have caught it.
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# --- Auto-generated IDE / build project files (Unity rewrites these) ---
# Note: Word-Crush.slnx is the canonical solution and is intentionally kept.
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Rider / Visual Studio
.idea/
.vs/

# --- Build outputs / packages ---
ExportedObj/
*.apk
*.aab
*.app
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
crashlytics-build.properties

# --- Crash reports ---
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
CLAUDE.md
